DESCRIPTION:The autumn feast of the mountain villages of Asfendiou (Zia\, Lagoudi\, Evangelistria) is Agios Dimitrios on 25-26 October\, with a vespers and a glendi with local food. A good excuse for the Zia sunset without the coach parties.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kos/#asfendiou-panigiri-of-agios-dimitrios-asfendiou
